  "content": "<p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/WeS8L88.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"982\" height=\"197\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/minecraft-mods/2755185\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft Forum</a> - <a href=\"https://github.com/MattCzyr/NaturesCompass\" rel=\"nofollow\">原始碼</a>&nbsp;- <a href=\"https://github.com/MattCzyr/NaturesCompass/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">問題追蹤</a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>自然指南針是一個實用物品，讓你能在世界中搜尋生態域的位置，並查看相關資訊。如果你正在尋找能定位結構的指南針，請參閱<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/explorers-compass\" rel=\"nofollow\">探險家指南針</a>。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>功能特色</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li>手持自然指南針右鍵點擊，會開啟生態域選擇介面，你可以從中搜尋生態域或查看相關資訊</li>\n<li>Shift+右鍵點擊會重設指南針的狀態</li>\n<li>當指南針未指向任何生態域時，它會指向世界重生點</li>\n<li>相容於所有生態域，無論是原版或模組新增的皆可</li>\n<li>在設定檔中可以調整如黑名單生態域和最大搜尋距離等項目</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>圖片展示</strong></span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rhz4gLR.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"965\" height=\"543\"></p><p><em>在 HUD 上顯示找到的生態域資訊</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GTSAfqv.png\" width=\"965\" height=\"543\"></p><p><em>生態域選擇介面</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vjsdZZ4.png\" width=\"965\" height=\"543\"></p><p><em>生態域資訊介面</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>合成配方</strong></span></p><p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/175k4oE.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"495\" height=\"246\"></p><p><em>樹苗和原木使用礦物辭典。</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>模組包</strong></span></p><p>是的，你可以在你的模組包中使用這個模組。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>贊助支持</strong></span></p><p>如果你喜歡這個模組並想支持本專案，歡迎透過 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fcgi-bin%252fwebscr%253freturn%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252f256087%2526cn%253dAdd%2bspecial%2binstructions%2bto%2bthe%2baddon%2bauthor()%2526business%253dmattczyr%2540gmail.com%2526bn%253dPP-DonationsBF%253abtn_donateCC_LG.gif%253aNonHosted%2526cancel_return%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252f256087%2526lc%253dUS%2526item_name%253dNotes%2b(from%2bcurseforge.com)%2526cmd%253d_donations%2526rm%253d1%2526no_shipping%253d1%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" rel=\"nofollow\">PayPal 捐贈</a>。非常感謝你的支持！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>贊助商</strong></span></p><p>本專案由 BisectHosting 贊助。如果你正在尋找伺服器託管服務，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fchaos\" rel=\"nofollow\">請參考他們的託管方案</a>，並在結帳時使用促銷代碼 <em>Chaos</em>，即可享有首月 75 折優惠！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fchaos\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/0998de1c-6d3e-4370-a553-0da42e986c68.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>",
